    "what_en": "In group chats, Claude speaks less. Unless @mentioned, it silently blocks its own outbound messages if it has spoken recently.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when Claude is in a group channel (Discord, Telegram, Slack, etc.) and was not @mentioned in the last 3 turns, and has spoken within the past minute or just joined.",
